    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:4",
      "back_en": "Tell me... Is this Chedo?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Archaic tone preserved; accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:16",
      "back_en": "I heard General Rhun took his troops to the heart of the capital... What's going to happen to him? I hope he's all right...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate; missing accents (coracao) cosmetic."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:17",
      "back_en": "The Empire...is finished.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Faithful."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:18",
      "back_en": "But there is still work to be done here.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:20",
      "back_en": "This is goodbye then, ?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:21",
      "back_en": "Yes. There are things I have to do...Like find General Rhun.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:24",
      "back_en": "Well...? I was only doing my duty as...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Ora' for 'Wha...?' acceptable interjection."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:25",
      "back_en": "I know. Still, we're allies now, not enemies...Right?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "AREAS043.DAT:7:0",
      "back_en": "Chedo, the Imperial Capital \"Hey there, fella... Everything okay?\"",
